      "code": "// the same form, two moods\npr = {\n  from: \"login\",\n  into: \"main\",\n  state: \"draft\",          // WIP sign on the folder\n  review_required: false   // until you mark it ready\n};\npr.state = \"ready\";        // now the stamp process starts"
